spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Wide Tilted Conveyor</b> is a structure that can be bought from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It is a wide sloping straight section of conveyor belt.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Wide Tilted Conveyor is otherwise functionally similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Tilted_Conveyor\" title=\"Tilted Conveyor\">Tilted Conveyor</a>. It is simply 2 studs wider. Like the Wide Straight Conveyor, it can be resized to be as short as 6 studs in length, or as long as 12 studs in length.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903090755\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 476/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019468/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.541      1 -total\n 85.12%   31.104      1 Template:Objects\n 14.74%    5.387      1 Template:Removed\n 11.08%    4.048      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:964-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903090755 and revision id 11466. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Removed","Structures","Conveyors"],"links":[{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Tilted Conveyor","exists